{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/205d03e34c3b50c13a2e9b0391100030.poster.avif?t=1758731505\" width=1170 height=473 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/205d03e34c3b50c13a2e9b0391100030.webm?t=1758731505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the swordsmith of Eren Keep, you turn steel into something more precious than gold. Customers come with coin in their hands and demands on their lips, seeking blades of deadly precision, balance, and beauty. Meet their requests and perfect your craft in one of the last beacons of civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/32ffeb33d5a5b1a0d8bf5eb884f88dea.webp?t=1758731505\" width=1560 height=56 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first chapter of Bladesong\u2019s <strong>Story Mode</strong>. You arrive at the gates of Eren Keep, one of the last safe havens of mankind. Forge blades for the refugees in the Camp and explore the ruins of the Lost City.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a taste of <strong>Creative Mode</strong>, Bladesong\u2019s swordmaking sandbox, and its wide range of tools, parts and materials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/830312489a2aa1ed8d30bda75ece338c.poster.avif?t=1758731505\" width=1170 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/830312489a2aa1ed8d30bda75ece338c.webm?t=1758731505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/f4e108b277441ddddfafe058639b4e59.webp?t=1758731505\" width=1560 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft swords your way using freeform blade shaping and an intricate modular building system. Create the weapons of any world \u2013 East to West, history to fantasy \u2013 with every detail customized, every piece meticulously crafted and adorned. Explore a selection from Bladesong\u2019s vast library of sword parts and engravings, with plenty of materials like metal, leather and wood to choose from. No two creations are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/ccbe1eafb45a69b4234a6d3316bcd066.poster.avif?t=1758731505\" width=1170 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/ccbe1eafb45a69b4234a6d3316bcd066.webm?t=1758731505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/cda1192a788756db56cd68f1b5bb7d18.webp?t=1758731505\" width=1560 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take commissions from warriors, nobles, and mercenaries. Meet their specific needs and expectations by balancing your sword ratings based on real-world physics. Learn how to curve blades and carve engravings, acquire rare materials, and expand your arsenal of sword parts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3107000?t=1758731505","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3107000?t=1758731505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/f36b586a4f411df7cf87383f326378c8f6a4da46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758731505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/f36b586a4f411df7cf87383f326378c8f6a4da46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758731505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/75fbfe27341664065cf3091488b2c359.avif?t=1758731505\" width=325 height=87 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/205d03e34c3b50c13a2e9b0391100030.poster.avif?t=1758731505\" width=1170 height=473 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/205d03e34c3b50c13a2e9b0391100030.webm?t=1758731505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the swordsmith of Eren Keep, you turn steel into something more precious than gold. Customers come with coin in their hands and demands on their lips, seeking blades of deadly precision, balance, and beauty. Meet their requests and perfect your craft in one of the last beacons of civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/32ffeb33d5a5b1a0d8bf5eb884f88dea.webp?t=1758731505\" width=1560 height=56 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first chapter of Bladesong\u2019s <strong>Story Mode</strong>. You arrive at the gates of Eren Keep, one of the last safe havens of mankind. Forge blades for the refugees in the Camp and explore the ruins of the Lost City.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a taste of <strong>Creative Mode</strong>, Bladesong\u2019s swordmaking sandbox, and its wide range of tools, parts and materials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/830312489a2aa1ed8d30bda75ece338c.poster.avif?t=1758731505\" width=1170 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/830312489a2aa1ed8d30bda75ece338c.webm?t=1758731505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/f4e108b277441ddddfafe058639b4e59.webp?t=1758731505\" width=1560 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft swords your way using freeform blade shaping and an intricate modular building system. Create the weapons of any world \u2013 East to West, history to fantasy \u2013 with every detail customized, every piece meticulously crafted and adorned. Explore a selection from Bladesong\u2019s vast library of sword parts and engravings, with plenty of materials like metal, leather and wood to choose from. No two creations are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107000/extras/ccbe1eafb45a69b4234a6d3316bcd066.poster.avif?t=1758731505\" width=1170 height=354 ><source src=\"htt